 S1 of ProvisionIndicator added for deployed turretsExtended time dropped flares are","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-21T03:18:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365759384","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2259580-1827626365749332","game_id":"steam-2259580","kind":"announcement","title":"Notice Regarding Linux Build & 1.1.0 in Beta Now","summary":"EDIT: 1.1.0 is now live on the beta branch (in game properties.)Linux build will need more time to diagnose unfortunately - but will be back up as soon as possible.Photo mode is being saved for the first content update - this is an early QOL update fixing stuff.Hey all,Thank you so much for all the feedback and support over the past week!!! It's been nice reading through it all.I'm writing this to let Linux users know that I have had to (temporarily) disable the Linux build and instead enforce r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-18T05:27:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365749332","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2259580-1826992588596436","game_id":"steam-2259580","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Available Now","summary":"The time has finally come to trespass the premises of XANNI-CORP. The XANNIBAN demo is now ready to download & play for free on the Steam store page:Don the Trespasser's vessel and contain rogue machines through fast point & click gameplay. Dash through facilities, manage limited resources, and end a grim epidemic deep below ground.Demo Features:CAMPAIGN: Enter the beginning of the campaign, and survive dark caverns & facilities filled with hazards, traps, and obstacles.NAVIGATION: Master a uniq",